   859	    """PLAN-021 ADR-052: extract Claude model ID from tool_response.
   860	
   861	    Anthropic API responses include a `model` field (e.g. "claude-fable-5",
   862	    "claude-opus-5", "claude-haiku-4-5"; older gens appear in replay). Some adapters nest
   863	    it under `response.model` or `content.model`. Returns the string if
   864	    found, else falls back to ADR-052 role-to-model policy table when
   865	    `subagent_type` is supplied; otherwise None.
   866	
   867	    Canonical IDs (PLAN-169 W2.10 D1 — current fleet; the table below is
   868	    the authority, this prose only illustrates):
   869	      - claude-fable-5 / claude-opus-5 → orchestrator + critical VETOs
   870	      - claude-sonnet-5                → mid-complexity workers
   871	      - claude-haiku-4-5               → high-frequency fan-out
   872	
   873	    PLAN-044 audit-v2 C3-P0-01 fix (Wave B): the Task tool response
   874	    shape from Claude Code's hook payload omits the `model` field on
