   166	for p in .claude docs .github SPEC .gitignore PROTOCOL.md .codex .grok .git/hooks AGENTS.md requirements.toml; do [ -e "<target>/$p" ] || [ -L "<target>/$p" ] || continue; find "<target>/$p" -type f -links +1; done
   167	find "<target>" -maxdepth 1 \( -name 'AGENTS.md.ceo-bak-*' -o -name 'requirements.toml.ceo-bak-*' \) \( -type l -o -links +1 \)
   168	```
   169	
