   171	directory (`python3 .claude/hooks/_lib/runtime_paths.py --state-dir` prints
   172	it) as `.salt` plus a `salt-minted.json` marker. v1.3.0 never owned those two
   173	names there. If a file of yours already sits at either path, the first
   174	prompt after the upgrade treats a `.salt` that is not exactly 32 bytes as
   175	malformed and truncates it in place, and replaces a regular
   176	`salt-minted.json` unconditionally (signed condition of rc.1). Move both out
   177	of the way BEFORE the first session.
   178	
