row for the §4(i) rationale and for why the integer encoding is load-bearing), `session_id` (explicit required kwarg on the typed emitter — the hook threads the PreToolUse event's own session id, no silent default), `project`, `event_schema`, `ts`, plus baseline `tokens_*`/`hmac`/`hmac_error`. PLAN-161 W2 C5 / CF-9 (2026-07-27) — canonical-edit review ENTERED marker, emitted by `check_pair_rail.py:_decide()` only after the kill-switch / non-write-tool / not-L3+ / sentinel-bypass arms have all returned (those paths emit NOTHING). The durable session-correlated DENOMINATOR for the /ceo-boot `pair_rail` activity-conditioned liveness row: a window session with expected-but-no-outcome is the S254 dead-rail class and escalates RED; zero expected + zero outcomes is vacuously green; a healthy outcome from session B never masks session A. Typed emitter `emit_pair_rail_review_expected`; dedicated deny-by-default `_PAIR_RAIL_REVIEW_EXPECTED_ALLOWLIST` scrub branch + closed-enum coercion, NEVER `_EMIT_GENERIC_PASSTHROUGH`. DENIED on the wire: file paths, proposed content, any review text. NO ATLAS technique (liveness telemetry, not a detection signal). |
